{
  "id": "small-office",
  "name": "Sample small office",
  "summary": "A firewall, a PoE switch, two desk switches, Wi-Fi, a NAS and two cameras on their own VLAN, already cabled. The lessons run in a copy of it.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "claim": "Every inside address in this sample is private address space (192.168.0.0/16).",
      "cite": "RFC 1918, Address Allocation for Private Internets, section 3, Private Address Space",
      "url": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1918.html",
      "read_on": "2026-10-10"
    },
    {
      "claim": "The firewall's outside address, 203.0.113.2, is in TEST-NET-3, kept for documentation, so nothing here names a real network.",
      "cite": "RFC 5737, IPv4 Address Blocks Reserved for Documentation, section 3",
      "url": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5737.html",
      "read_on": "2026-10-25"
    },
    {
      "claim": "The firewall's configuration uses Junos set statements for interfaces, security zones and policies between zones, the forms Fathom's SRX dictionary reads (corpus/dict/junos-srx, each file citing its own page).",
      "cite": "Juniper Networks, policies (Security), Junos CLI reference",
      "url": "https://www.juniper.net/documentation/us/en/software/junos/cli-reference/topics/ref/statement/security-edit-policies.html",
      "read_on": "2026-08-15"
    },
    {
      "claim": "Device models, their port counts and which switch ports give PoE are the catalogue's, and cite their own sources there.",
      "cite": "corpus/catalogue/ (each model's own source block)",
      "url": "",
      "read_on": "2026-10-25"
    }
  ],
  "rack": {
    "label": "Comms cabinet",
    "heightU": 12,
    "numbering": "ascending"
